EVALUATION.md §11.1 (log-2026-09-29 M4 U6-r): a variant case that itself declares an input field; one environment variable must map to one field of one value, and a case is never reached through record fields alone.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local variant Source {
  env {
    key: input String? from env "KEY"
  }
  fixed {
    key: String
  }
}

/// The config.
let src: Source = fixed { key: "k" }
-- findings.txt --
error[E1903]  a/a.canon:4:3
  variant case Source.env declares an input field: input fields are allowed only in records

1 error, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
